cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Batang, please cite it as below, and also cite the original
  datasets you use (see DATASETS.md).
title: "Batang: standardized public lithium-ion battery ageing data"
abstract: >-
  Batang (바탕, "foundation" in Korean) standardizes public battery
  ageing datasets cell by cell into one Parquet schema with unified units,
  cycle segmentation, cycle kinds and a single SOH definition, and offers them
  as a database, a web explorer and downloadable files.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Park
    given-names: Jimin
    affiliation: "Department of Battery Conflation Engineering, Yonsei University"
    email: pjm@yonsei.ac.kr
url: "https://batang.yonsei.ac.kr"
repository: "https://github.com/pjmbatman/batang"
version: "2.0"
date-released: "2026-10-23"
keywords:
  - lithium-ion battery
  - battery degradation
  - state of health
  - dataset standardization
